:name: VoltDragon Node A
:description: Single STM32F407 node running the Node A firmware.
:
: Usage (from the repository root):
:   renode renode/node_a.resc
:   renode --console --disable-gui renode/node_a.resc    (headless, UART in log)
:
: Override the firmware with:  $bin_a=@path/to/node_a.elf  before including this script.

$bin_a?=$ORIGIN/../build/debug/firmware/node_a/node_a.elf

using sysbus
mach create "node_a"
machine LoadPlatformDescription $ORIGIN/stm32f407.repl

# Honour SCB_CCR.DIV_0_TRP so integer division by zero traps as on silicon.
nvic FilterCcrDiv0Write false

showAnalyzer sysbus.usart2

# A reset (watchdog or SYSRESETREQ) reloads the firmware but keeps RAM, so the
# .noinit reset record survives just as it does on real hardware.
macro reset
"""
    sysbus LoadELF $bin_a
"""
runMacro $reset
